					<p>
						On top of those two files, I built the <strong>design system</strong> for the platform.
					</p>
					<p>
						It did three jobs at once. It let me <strong>ideate and iterate fast</strong>. It let <strong>non-designers on the team produce work that stayed on-system</strong>. And it gave developers an <strong>exact token taxonomy</strong> at handoff, so the spec and the build spoke the same language.
					</p>
