						THREE TRANSFERABLE PRINCIPLES & IMPLEMENTATIONS
					</div>
					<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 font-departure text-xs">
						<!-- Principle 1 -->
						<div class="border border-black p-5 bg-[#faf8f2]">
							<span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold block mb-1">PRINCIPLE 01</span>
							<strong class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-black block mb-2 leading-tight">
								Make trust a visible property
							</strong>
							<p class="font-sans text-xs text-black/70 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								Data without provenance gets discounted. Attach assurance tiers and lineage directly to the primary surface.
							</p>
							<div class="bg-white border border-black/15 p-2 text-[11px] text-black">
								<strong>Feature:</strong> Trust Tier Badges &amp; 5-Hop Lineage
							</div>
						</div>

