							<span class="text-emerald-700 font-bold block mb-1">PRINCIPLE 02</span>
							<strong class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-black block mb-2 leading-tight">
								Gates in the authoring path
							</strong>
							<p class="font-sans text-xs text-black/70 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
								Post-submission review burdens central teams. Enforce validation at entry so bad data cannot enter the catalog.
							</p>
							<div class="bg-white border border-black/15 p-2 text-[11px] text-black">
								<strong>Feature:</strong> In-Flow Form Validation Gates
							</div>
						</div>

